%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e40ab277a83ed7c49b82bbd432f209c7, type: 3}
  m_Name: MainRouteSchedule
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Demon.Slice::Demon.Slice.NineDayDefinition
  Days:
  - Title: First watch
    Objective: The last watch left orders on the table. Check the two chests behind the cabin before dark.
    WakeHour: 8
  - Title: A trail in the snow
    Objective: Fresh boot prints lead off the path. Find out who went into the cave.
    WakeHour: 8
  - Title: As foretold
    Objective: The wind is still blowing. At the edge of the wood are marks far larger than my boots.
    WakeHour: 8
  - Title: The ritual ground
    Objective: I haven't checked the old ritual ground. I'll take the long way round on patrol.
    WakeHour: 8
  - Title: A voice across the lake
    Objective: The radio screams. Yesterday's tune seems to be coming across the water.
    WakeHour: 8
  - Title: The listening post
    Objective: Try the old listening post. The bells have hung there for years. Why have I never heard one ring?
    WakeHour: 8
  - Title: A sun that will not rise
    Objective: The clock says morning. Check the old observations and the lock behind the cabin.
    WakeHour: 8
  - Title: Relief overdue
    Objective: Handover today. Read the book first. Go down to the shore after dark.
    WakeHour: 8
  - Title: Day Nine
    Objective: Footsteps on the lake.
    WakeHour: 8
  Tablets:
  - Title: Tablet I
    DiscoveryDay: 2
    DateNodeDay: 3
    Record: Three notches in the top row. The cut at the lower left matches the stamp on the vane's spindle.
  - Title: Tablet II
    DiscoveryDay: 3
    DateNodeDay: 5
    Record: Five notches this time. The familiar figure is there, but the middle stone bears two cuts facing opposite ways.
  - Title: Tablet III
    DiscoveryDay: 4
    DateNodeDay: 7
    Record: Seven notches. A sunburst like the one in the old sunrise log sits in the last row.
  - Title: Tablet IV
    DiscoveryDay: 5
    DateNodeDay: 9
    Record: Nine notches. I recognise the figure from all three earlier stones. The last stone is whole.
  - Title: Tablet V
    DiscoveryDay: 6
    DateNodeDay: 0
    Record: Two cuts match the stamp on the bell frame. The empty sockets are worn from use.
  - Title: Tablet VI
    DiscoveryDay: 7
    DateNodeDay: 0
    Record: Hold the light on the tracks. When they stop, look up at the vane. Take the beam away and look again.
  FirstNightOpeningHour: 22
  FinalTabletDay: 8
  FinalTabletHour: 22
  FirstNightMessage: Ice splits out on the lake. I can hear it through the storm.
